WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.300
Private equity diligence begins
with a mountain of SEC filings.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.600
DiligenceIQ turns them into decisions.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.000
Pick a company.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.400
Before you ask anything, you see
how NVIDIA is performing,

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.300
what changed across its filings,

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.100
and what deserves a closer look —

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.200
every figure straight from the filing,

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.000
every line you can check.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.300
Have a question? Just ask.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.100
Retrieval searches the filings, then
exactly one model call writes your answer.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.700
These are the real steps — no black box.

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:35.300
The result is a Diligence Brief,

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.500
structured like an investment memo.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.850
Every claim opens its source passage,

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:45.100
and every number is verified
against the filing it cites.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.600
Compare companies side by side —

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:52.800
see where they move together,
and where they diverge.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:55.700
DiligenceIQ.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:59.500
Know what changed, what matters,
and what to investigate next.
